  "body": "Direct-PR: daily refresh of the README milestone table, under the operator's standing authorization (docs only, self-merged when CI is green).\n\nThe problem: the \"Lots done\" column of the README milestone table was dated 2026-11-02.\n\nWhat changed: the date and three counts (M3 29 of 43, M4 1 of 22, M5 0 of 30), taken from the daily board render (`tooling/roadmap`). Nothing else.\n\nTests: docs only, no code.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the milestone table date to November 3, 2026.\n  * Refreshed completed-lot counts for M3, M4, and M5; M1 and M2 counts are unchanged.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
